{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-gateway-porto-al-zorah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"gateway-porto-al-zorah","about":"Gateway Porto Al Zorah, a prime residential offering in a district surrounded by the stunning natural beauty of mangroves and creeks, presents a diverse range of apartments, from studios to spacious 1-3 bedroom units and luxurious 2-3 bedroom duplexes, all at the heart of Al Zorah Gateway Porto. This enclave, encircled by a picturesque marina boardwalk and a waterfront promenade, not only promises serene living spaces but also aligns perfectly with the natural landscape at Gateway Porto Al Zorah.The architectural design of Gateway Porto Al Zorah draws heavily on minimalist Mediterranean principles, with a modern twist, ensuring that each apartment at Al Zorah Gateway Porto maximizes space and harmonizes with its environment. The complex's internal courtyard, a standout feature of Gateway Porto Al Zorah, invites natural light and ventilation, fostering a community-centric space for relaxation and interaction among Al Zorah Gateway Porto residents.Emphasizing the seamless integration with nature, Gateway Porto Al Zorah offers breathtaking views of the mangrove reserve and golf fairways, positioning Al Zorah Gateway Porto as a coveted location for those seeking proximity to the beach and the leisure amenities of Al Zorah, making it an ideal choice for prospective residents and investors alike.","price":840000,"title":"Gateway Porto Al Zorah","bitrix":{"id":343,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"⁠Gateway Porto Al Zorah","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"⁠Gateway Porto Al Zorah","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Al Zorah Development","project_location":"Al Zorah City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/gateway_porto_feature_9ad47c6710.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/gateway